#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/includedir.rst:17
msgid ""
"The base path to be searched for header files. The default value is "
"``include`` and indicates that the folder is located at the root of the "
"library. Setting ``includeDir`` to ``.`` will change the base path to the "
"root of the library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/includedir.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you need to export additional relative paths, refer to :ref:"
"`library_json_buid_flags`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/includedir.rst:26
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ldf` will pick a library automatically only when a project or "
"other dependent libraries include any header file located in ``includeDir`` "
"or ``srcDir``."
msgstr ""

